{"type":"message","id":"56078dad","parentId":"2ffe7b7e","timestamp":"2026-03-25T12:30:34.282Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Exploring custom skills**\n\nI think I need to inspect similar custom skills, like patient-klm, to see how they work. This might help me create something useful with a script. It sounds like a practical way to start implementing the skills I need. So, my first step is to initiate that process. Let’s dive into it and see what I can learn from those examples to make my own script better!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_07b564d7ba2ad3370169c3d56740a88191b0352c7e3966e902\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpw9Vq9jsD3_JuYMiBSsn-F7PnNHdNqaCB9zdwVIZJ59FtluJdyGJdXaHSju5Ns9T4VzDBehNHQqdRs-cACd4NSvClo_huwE1WCyduV2aY_lrlQVL0bnvD9dVd-RYP7RiJ2eQiEAjP2LsWF1Q63zjU04T5EU5X5gfxiIFGRoTN0zXnFoAPtX8Bs3kbG-so9TVsgJLCAtgzRpeWmiP8DfgTLVl5Y72K3zdKlirIUO9BbbGuH1gU5eeKS6h-sltpzOv5a3McSlMCawaFzl-Jc6wqnxW3k8KbevaBgdxJEdlipTOA3NEIBh5jrXuwYnt86N94AfrlEsG2YqHS-oCjggqj-Mz1nQqwCeQkCbDf0Jj4-JPJciNtIc0WK8ux7Egz4QYrHQcUJ08yKIpl2XoGj9Fhr0DgTE1P3z7_0n1IP5OER40wcrIGNyNT6b6gTOZP7LNtogxmEGSilfBaVmXIPqC6nv8Jk90ZW5fwsfuqUpvUh0WX37PbtEfEwz-UhZLl1N3wCWihIGb87sC8K5-dECUJ4C902iYPbrQLe9rN0yDTDWkaz75sSHAeBvvfzwYKwzF-pT5PCAqhkMNSKibXZFl4rIeloQccNutWhD4H2-KVAx1acCk_wmZ0n7PHLmxDsX3JR45T_YKuqRJl_gXks4ESzClvlbuYEbl3uttmKwfwIhjSNSac8tyV59nRb8NpBuozVD5EhaqkyLpr3MRkMVBncdFYINIOTe8RMRQTq4m7z-VlcqAxLXT03Vwxnes4PxFG-Hq_xEshDwzcFFIGKrk_wavpa409zV46DtnBxzmY-J6hqYOeeqnslYUbNRHpjV6FeCESx6Z0FRjaEmLAV4zFVyQK07KFfTpzct3YZc2A_qmTpTDkyhioF6ex8sCAHK3L3w6B24LwGfJncMiFndEmLiJAXnqJlhUT9EQ7Y4w_pgYqOVysrmhUoPM04g3_coMShOVbx2gruWTsS_6aSu8Uhek8rQ==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Exploring custom skills**\\n\\nI think I need to inspect similar custom skills, like patient-klm, to see how they work. This might help me create something useful with a script. It sounds like a practical way to start implementing the skills I need. So, m